# Stage 8 far layer (factor 3/16, y = 0): the mountains above Bad Ischl.
# The Katrin as a long lit f ridge rising from the valley to a rocky summit
# (x ~290) with jagged rock bands (F streaks), forest texture (rows of
# short F tree dashes on the lit flanks, f dashes in the shadow) and 1 px
# tree-tip serrations along the ridge line; shadowed F flanks right of the
# fall lines from the summit and the second top (x ~362); the cable car's
# line as a 1 px F diagonal up the lit flank to a tiny F top station; the
# Siriuskogel as a small wooded hump in front (right); behind the col, a
# far glimpse of the Dachstein's peaks in h snow with f rock ribs.
# Colours f F h only (art-style 7), no k, no outlines. Tiles horizontally
# (the profile at x 639 meets x 0 at y 112).
# Drawn by the pixel-artist with a throwaway script; the grid is the source.
sprite = bg_katrin
size   = 640x150
origin = 0,0
anim   = idle frames=1
---
frame idle 0
